<title>USA: Comstock Resources sets 97 drilling budget.</title>
<headline>Comstock Resources sets 97 drilling budget.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comstock Resources Inc said Thursday it expects to spend $30 million in 1997 on 48 identified development and exploration projects.</p>
<p>About 15 percent of the $30 million will be for exploration projects, the company said. To date in 1997, Comstock has participated in 11 wells, 8 development wells and 3 exploratory wells.</p>
<p>The eighteen successful wells completed in 1996 along with the three successful 1997 wells that were recently completed are currently producing about 10.5 million cubic feet equivalent of natural gas per day net to Comstock's interest.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
